{"time": 1768230325, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1534716230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“那个.......”她格外踌躇的看向你来，先前总是低着头的少女，在这时小心翼翼的撇了眼你，甚至于不理解她的人或许会认为这是种冒犯"}
{"time": 1768230341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1311738499", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“阳光？”"}
{"time": 1768230491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2101845606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“错误的”#双手摆出×的形状，然后用手拉开一点头发，让尖耳动一下“要不要摸摸看，和你的蒂芙尼一样款式的耳朵，摸了或许会有好运发生哦”#不过全程动作和声音都不大就是了"}
{"time": 1768230538, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2011747310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=843541624][CQ:at,qq=2275904091] （我明天玩玩看）"}
