{"time": 1768288125, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1812004455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯，如你们所见，这些加入的人都是男性，以及这些夸张的发型不是必须的”"}
{"time": 1768288139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "307317284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（气笑了）"}
