{"time": 1768656221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "389439113", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“额。。。这样啊，那她之后的命运是什么呢”"}
